    "B08’s native positive conditional consumer is unchanged baseline behavior; no new candidate wave establishes that complete standard served branch. The exact five-case wave includes one focused actual-N5/Foundry consumer case and is otherwise primarily mismatch/blocker/tamper negatives.",
    "The factual C/F observation rule and served-profile evidence are UNRUN; B09 remains open as separately cited in the wave catalogue. No row outcome or source status is changed by this slice receipt."
  ],
